# ★These files ARE committed now, deliberately. See
# scripts/download-vendor-libs.sh for the reasoning: reproducible builds,
# checksummed integrity, offline builds, and a test that would otherwise skip
# itself against a bare checkout.
#
# They used to be ignored and downloaded during the Docker build from partly
# unpinned URLs with no checksum, so two builds could bake different
# JavaScript into the artifact sandbox — and did (@babel/standalone rolled
# from 7.x to 8.0.4, a major version, unnoticed).
#
# Nothing is ignored here. To move a version:
#   UPDATE_MANIFEST=1 bash scripts/download-vendor-libs.sh frontend/public/libs
# then review the diff before committing.
